   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Contract clause flagger\nReads a contract PDF and runs two checks at once: risky clauses and key dates and amounts. High-risk finds alert you.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Quotes the exact text for every flag so you can verify. It is a checklist, not legal advice.\n\nA failed run alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
